//    is what a fixed-column pixel search matches, not tick `t`'s own value.
//    LAYER MODEL: `BLDCNT = TGT1_BG1|BLEND|TGT2_BG3|TGT2_OBJ` (0x1842,
//    RAM-confirmed) with BG1 = `entrySlide` (source: `DrawBattleEntryBackground`'s
